; The rate of an inverse price, a zero price, a negative one, and a path through a third commodity.
2026-01-01 open Assets:Quarter
2026-01-01 open Assets:Tenth
2026-01-01 open Assets:Zero
2026-01-01 open Assets:Negative
2026-01-01 open Assets:Short
2026-01-01 open Assets:Chain
2026-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2026-01-01 open Equity:Other

; EUR is worth 4 QTR, so QTR is worth 0.25 EUR
2026-02-01 price EUR 4 QTR
; EUR is worth 0.1 TNT, so TNT is worth 10 EUR, which Decimal division writes as 1E+1
2026-02-01 price EUR 0.1 TNT
; a price of zero: valuing ZER in EUR gives zero; the inverse of zero does not exist
2026-02-01 price ZER 2 EUR
2026-02-02 price ZER 0 EUR
; a price of zero and no other: EUR has no rate to NIL
2026-02-01 price NIL 0 EUR
; a negative price
2026-02-01 price NEG -0.50 EUR
; CAD is worth USD, USD is worth EUR: no path of two prices is followed
2026-02-01 price CAD 2 USD
2026-02-01 price USD 0.40 EUR

2026-01-02 * "hold"
  Assets:Quarter   10 QTR
  Assets:Tenth     10 TNT
  Assets:Zero      10 ZER
  Assets:Negative  -4 NEG
  Assets:Short     -2.50 ZER
  Assets:Chain      3 CAD
  Assets:Cash      10 EUR
  Equity:Other    -10 QTR
  Equity:Other    -10 TNT
  Equity:Other    -10 ZER
  Equity:Other      4 NEG
  Equity:Other     -3 CAD
  Equity:Other      2.50 ZER
  Equity:Other    -10 EUR
